// Cloudflare Worker config. Nitro merges this into .output/server/wrangler.json at build time.
// Secrets (SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, DEEPL_API_KEY, GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY)
// are NOT stored here — set them with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
